OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'attacked' partner hours
OL,4,Abefore she died, murder trial told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of murdering his partner
OL,7,Fallegedly assaulted her hours before
OL,8,Fshe was found dead.
OL,10,FAlexander Brennan, 54, denies killing
OL,11,FBrodie MacGregor, 23, at her flat in
OL,12,FGlasgow's Springburn on 26 August 2024.
OL,14,FOn the opening day of the trial jurors
OL,15,Fheard that during a 999 call at 04:37
OL,16,FMacGregor could be heard to say: "You
OL,17,Fattacked me."
OL,19,FBut when officers showed up at the
OL,20,Fproperty at 05:13 she told them said
OL,21,Fwas safe with her "friend" Brennan.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
